WEBVTT

00:01.521 --> 00:02.941
[♪ mysterious music playing]

00:03.021 --> 00:04.861
[CAPTAIN]
Checking the landing area.

00:04.941 --> 00:06.941
[BALCUS] I want us ready
to disembark. Hurry!

00:07.031 --> 00:08.451
[indistinct chatter]

00:11.031 --> 00:12.621
Everyone's off the ship.

00:12.701 --> 00:14.201
We are heading back into battle.

00:14.281 --> 00:15.451
Excuse me, sir.

00:15.541 --> 00:16.951
We're going with you.

00:17.041 --> 00:19.331
[BALCUS] You boys
are in no shape to fight.

00:19.411 --> 00:21.961
It's best you remain here
with the other evacuees.

00:22.041 --> 00:23.341
But we can--

00:23.421 --> 00:25.421
[CLARICE] Don't be so stubborn,
you two.

00:25.501 --> 00:28.881
You've both already proven
your courage 10 times over.

00:28.971 --> 00:30.301
[RAYMOND] Really? You think so?

00:30.381 --> 00:31.721
Absolutely.

00:31.801 --> 00:33.261
And Leon will be fine.

00:33.351 --> 00:35.051
I mean, you trust him, right?

00:36.391 --> 00:37.931
Yeah, of course.

00:38.561 --> 00:40.101
I mean, why wouldn't we?

00:41.441 --> 00:43.111
Wait, what am I saying?

00:43.191 --> 00:44.861
What a crock!

00:44.941 --> 00:46.111
[groans]

00:47.821 --> 00:49.151
[Leon, Vandel grunting]

00:49.241 --> 00:50.861
♪

00:55.121 --> 00:56.871
[COMMANDER] At this rate,
we'll be wiped out!

01:00.621 --> 01:01.961
[Leon, Vandel grunting]

01:03.961 --> 01:05.501
[grunts]

01:06.041 --> 01:08.211
What were you expecting,
you amateur?

01:08.301 --> 01:09.921
Merging with that odd vehicle

01:10.011 --> 01:12.631
didn't do much to help you,
did it? [coughs]

01:14.721 --> 01:16.221
[gasps]

01:16.301 --> 01:18.101
[clears throat]
Villains of the kingdom

01:18.181 --> 01:19.521
have earned no mercy.

01:19.601 --> 01:21.731
The same kindness
you extended to us!

01:21.811 --> 01:24.561
[LUXION] My assessment is that
he has lost his mind.

01:24.651 --> 01:27.321
The magical item
has completely taken over.

01:27.401 --> 01:28.321
[LEON] Damn it.

01:28.611 --> 01:30.571
Are you that desperate
to keep fighting?

01:30.651 --> 01:32.071
Surrender!

01:32.151 --> 01:34.031
[yells]

01:39.081 --> 01:41.041
[♪ opening theme song playing]

03:09.791 --> 03:10.881
Wait a sec.

03:10.961 --> 03:12.921
I know a way
to stop that monster.

03:14.131 --> 03:15.211
[Julius gasps]
Are you sure, Marie?

03:15.301 --> 03:17.931
-I mean, Lady Marie?
-Yeah.

03:19.051 --> 03:21.221
I only took a quick look
at the cutscene

03:21.301 --> 03:23.431
when I opened
my brother's save file, but...

03:24.721 --> 03:25.931
[CLEARE] The monster
is being controlled

03:26.021 --> 03:28.351
by some item
called the magic flute.

03:28.441 --> 03:31.311
She's right. It happened
back during our school trip.

03:31.401 --> 03:33.691
I saw monsters
being summoned firsthand.

03:34.321 --> 03:35.651
[JILK] But where is it?

03:36.361 --> 03:37.401
[CLEARE] I am detecting

03:37.491 --> 03:38.571
the source
of the instrument's sound

03:38.651 --> 03:39.951
on that ship.

03:41.201 --> 03:42.741
We have no choice.

03:42.831 --> 03:45.081
This suffering cannot continue.

03:45.161 --> 03:46.411
Roger.

03:46.501 --> 03:48.621
Head over
and stop whoever's playing it!

03:48.711 --> 03:51.171
Please.
Who do you think you are?

03:51.251 --> 03:53.041
You can't order us around.

03:53.131 --> 03:55.211
[MARIE] How are you all
so freaking clueless?!

03:55.881 --> 03:57.591
Whatever. Just do it!

03:58.051 --> 04:01.261
[KYLE] Honestly, mistress,
you're as impetuous as ever.

04:02.851 --> 04:04.261
[Leon grunting]

04:04.351 --> 04:06.931
Something wrong?
Is that all you got?!

04:07.021 --> 04:08.231
Give it up already, gramps!

04:10.311 --> 04:11.691
[growls]

04:12.271 --> 04:13.561
[MARIE] Watch out!

04:13.651 --> 04:14.941
Damn it!

04:18.951 --> 04:20.401
♪

04:20.911 --> 04:23.701
[all screaming]

04:24.581 --> 04:25.911
[MARIE] I can't
take this anymore!

04:25.991 --> 04:27.751
[CLEARE] How very
unsaintly of her.

04:27.831 --> 04:30.501
And really,
she need not be so concerned.

04:30.581 --> 04:31.671
Why, Clearey?

04:32.461 --> 04:33.501
[CLEARE] Did you
give me a nickname

04:33.581 --> 04:35.001
to indicate familiarity?

04:35.461 --> 04:37.131
That is most congenial of you.

04:37.801 --> 04:40.171
As for why I am confident
of our success,

04:40.261 --> 04:43.091
that is because we have
a certain sourpuss escorting us.

04:44.261 --> 04:45.601
[LUXION] Energy fully charged.

04:46.221 --> 04:48.351
Firing boson particle cannon.

04:59.401 --> 05:01.281
[JULIUS] Whoa!
What was that beam?

05:01.361 --> 05:03.451
I've never seen magic
like that before!

05:03.531 --> 05:05.871
[Cleare laughs]
Yes, that is right.

05:05.951 --> 05:09.371
It is magic.
Incredibly powerful magic.

05:10.461 --> 05:12.411
No. It's something else.

05:13.041 --> 05:15.041
[BOTH] Surely
the demon lord's wrath!

05:15.131 --> 05:18.051
[The Final Boss growling]

05:18.131 --> 05:19.591
Hurry up, Kyle!

05:19.671 --> 05:21.971
Before that monster
has time to regenerate!

05:22.051 --> 05:24.011
Yes, I'm working on it.

05:28.601 --> 05:30.681
[JULIUS] Follow my lead!
We'll provide backup!

05:30.771 --> 05:32.351
[ALL] Don't tell us what to do!

05:33.441 --> 05:34.731
[all panting]

05:38.731 --> 05:40.901
[MARIE] There's the magic flute!
Told ya!

05:40.991 --> 05:41.951
That girl.

05:42.651 --> 05:43.571
Hertrude!

05:44.241 --> 05:46.031
How did you get here?

05:46.121 --> 05:48.161
Wait, were you playing it?

05:48.241 --> 05:49.621
[♪ somber music playing]

05:49.701 --> 05:52.121
I'll destroy every
last one of them.

05:52.751 --> 05:54.501
Please, you have to stop this.

05:54.581 --> 05:57.131
At this rate,
there won't be anyone left!

05:58.041 --> 05:59.251
So what?

05:59.881 --> 06:01.171
What are you saying?

06:01.631 --> 06:04.551
Your own people will be killed
because of you!

06:04.631 --> 06:06.591
We can end this right now!

06:06.681 --> 06:08.311
-No.
-[gasps]

06:08.971 --> 06:10.771
-I must see it through.
-You mustn't.

06:10.851 --> 06:13.441
If you wanna kill me,
then go ahead and do it!

06:13.521 --> 06:16.771
Even if I die, it won't halt
the guardian of the land!

06:16.851 --> 06:18.481
-It'll just keep reviving!
-[gasps]

06:21.321 --> 06:22.691
[ANGELICA] I understand
you hate us,

06:22.781 --> 06:24.031
and you have every right,

06:24.111 --> 06:26.071
but what's the point
of continuing this?

06:26.161 --> 06:28.531
All you'll do is cause
more needless deaths!

06:28.621 --> 06:30.081
Oh, shut up.

06:30.161 --> 06:31.911
[ANGELICA] Don't forget
the principality can trace

06:32.001 --> 06:33.961
its roots back
to the Holfort royals.

06:34.621 --> 06:35.621
[scoffs]

06:36.081 --> 06:37.581
Believe me, I know.

06:37.671 --> 06:39.341
But the simple fact is
I don't care

06:39.421 --> 06:40.541
what happens anymore.

06:40.631 --> 06:41.801
[both gasp]

06:42.211 --> 06:43.551
Excuse me?

06:44.171 --> 06:45.091
That's right.

06:45.631 --> 06:47.051
I don't care what happens

06:47.141 --> 06:49.681
to the principality
after the way they exploited us,

06:49.761 --> 06:51.431
me and my sister.

06:52.471 --> 06:55.351
Turns out they were the ones
who killed our parents.

06:55.441 --> 06:57.811
We never realized
we were being manipulated.

06:59.191 --> 07:00.231
[gasps softly]

07:00.691 --> 07:03.071
[HERTRUDE] Everything I loved
has been stolen from me.

07:03.151 --> 07:04.611
Even my sister, Rauda!

07:05.741 --> 07:07.531
I don't trust anyone!

07:07.611 --> 07:10.411
As far as I'm concerned,
they should be erased!

07:10.491 --> 07:12.581
I want nothing
from this hopeless world

07:12.661 --> 07:15.211
except its total destruction!

07:15.291 --> 07:17.461
My family was ripped away!

07:17.541 --> 07:20.791
I've earned the right
to avenge them! Haven't I?

07:21.291 --> 07:22.881
We were innocent kids.

07:23.511 --> 07:25.341
-Didn't we deserve to be happy?
-[gasps]

07:25.421 --> 07:26.591
[HERTRUDE] Well?!

07:26.671 --> 07:28.721
Still, it's wrong!

07:28.801 --> 07:30.391
Taking your rage
out on the world!

07:31.141 --> 07:32.681
What's revenge going to achieve?

07:33.311 --> 07:36.101
Besides, this isn't what
your sister would've wanted.

07:36.181 --> 07:37.101
[MARIE] You moron!

07:37.191 --> 07:38.351
Stop dreaming!

07:38.441 --> 07:40.271
I swear, you're living
in a fantasy world!

07:40.351 --> 07:41.981
-[gasps]
-[gasps] Miss Marie?

07:42.071 --> 07:44.231
Hey, wait. What are you saying?

07:44.321 --> 07:45.651
Whose side are you on?

07:45.731 --> 07:46.991
Sorry, which side?

07:47.071 --> 07:48.861
I'm with team reality!

07:48.951 --> 07:51.321
Stop spouting
idealistic nonsense!

07:51.411 --> 07:53.621
You think revenge
is so terrible?

07:53.701 --> 07:56.291
You know her life?
What she's been through?

07:56.371 --> 07:59.291
Suddenly you're an expert on
what her sister wouldn't want?

07:59.371 --> 08:01.081
And who even told you
you had the right

08:01.171 --> 08:02.751
to speak on her behalf anyway?

08:02.841 --> 08:04.801
-Pipe down!
-You're right, but--

08:04.881 --> 08:06.211
All the misery
she's been through,

08:06.301 --> 08:08.381
and you expected her
to lie down and take it?!

08:08.471 --> 08:10.551
She deserves happiness
like anyone else!

08:11.221 --> 08:13.721
Did you ever
once think about her feelings?

08:14.721 --> 08:16.931
You don't have
any problem lecturing her,

08:17.021 --> 08:18.311
but if you lost your loved ones,

08:18.391 --> 08:20.151
would you just
throw your arms in the air?

08:20.651 --> 08:22.271
You're telling me
you wouldn't fight,

08:22.351 --> 08:23.361
even if it was wrong?

08:23.441 --> 08:24.981
I'm... I'm not sure what--

08:25.071 --> 08:27.781
I bet you've never felt
soul-crushing regret!

08:27.861 --> 08:30.151
Have you ever lost
anyone close to you?

08:30.241 --> 08:31.951
Realized you'd never
see them again?!

08:32.781 --> 08:34.321
Take it from me!

08:34.411 --> 08:36.331
There's no worse feeling
in the world,

08:36.411 --> 08:38.751
and it never
completely goes away!

08:38.831 --> 08:40.621
Fine! We get it!

08:40.711 --> 08:42.421
But finding a way
to stop that monster

08:42.501 --> 08:43.591
should be our priority!

08:43.671 --> 08:45.091
You don't get it!

08:45.171 --> 08:47.631
If this is all it takes
to destroy this stupid world,

08:47.711 --> 08:49.471
I say let it crumble!

08:49.551 --> 08:51.471
And yeah,
of course I know it's wrong

08:51.551 --> 08:53.681
and that we shouldn't
let it happen, but...

08:54.641 --> 08:57.721
it's also wrong
to let people go unpunished!

09:02.351 --> 09:03.481
[inhales]

09:03.561 --> 09:05.111
[♪ playing melody]

09:05.191 --> 09:06.401
[all gasp]

09:25.751 --> 09:27.591
[growling]

09:40.231 --> 09:41.141
[exhales]

09:41.811 --> 09:43.101
-Who would've thought?
-[gasps]

09:43.191 --> 09:45.401
Of all the people
who would come to my defense,

09:45.481 --> 09:47.561
the Saint who only cares
about money was willing

09:47.651 --> 09:49.191
to stand up for me.

09:49.271 --> 09:50.191
[scoffs]

09:50.611 --> 09:53.151
Is that what you think?
Because I wasn't.

09:53.241 --> 09:54.821
I just couldn't stand these two

09:54.911 --> 09:56.911
and their
"main character" syndrome.

09:59.201 --> 10:00.701
I'm still glad you spoke up,

10:01.161 --> 10:02.871
or I never would've
felt this way.

10:04.121 --> 10:05.081
Yeah, whatever.

10:05.671 --> 10:07.211
So, are you really okay
with this?

10:07.291 --> 10:08.341
Of course not.

10:09.381 --> 10:12.051
[sighs] I didn't want it
to go this far.

10:13.261 --> 10:14.171
I'm through.

10:14.931 --> 10:17.601
[growling]

10:17.681 --> 10:18.551
[gasps]

10:19.181 --> 10:20.891
Hurry. You have to leave.

10:21.391 --> 10:23.101
Get as far away
from me as possible.

10:23.181 --> 10:24.101
[ALL] Huh?

10:24.181 --> 10:25.811
[ANGELICA] What's wrong?

10:25.901 --> 10:27.361
[HERTRUDE] The cost
of summoning guardians

10:27.441 --> 10:29.691
with the instrument
is the user's life.

10:29.771 --> 10:31.111
I've broken the contract,

10:31.191 --> 10:33.071
and the consequences
will be severe.

10:33.151 --> 10:36.241
I will never be able
to play this flute again.

10:36.321 --> 10:39.071
The guardian will kill me
for breaking our agreement.

10:39.161 --> 10:40.241
Stop this!

10:40.911 --> 10:41.951
No, but...

10:42.661 --> 10:44.871
The principality surrenders.

10:44.961 --> 10:46.211
We're defeated.

10:47.081 --> 10:50.001
[growling]

10:50.091 --> 10:52.341
[Vandel grunts, coughs]

10:52.421 --> 10:54.171
[both grunting]

10:54.261 --> 10:56.841
[CLEARE] Everyone, stand clear!

10:58.181 --> 11:00.101
-[slams]
-[all gasp]

11:00.181 --> 11:01.721
[ANGELICA] Livia!
Are you all right?

11:01.811 --> 11:03.101
[HERTRUDE] Vandel!

11:03.181 --> 11:04.641
[LEON] Is that...

11:04.731 --> 11:07.151
It is. Why are they down there?

11:07.231 --> 11:08.401
[gasps]

11:09.191 --> 11:10.861
And Princess Hertrude's
with them?!

11:11.941 --> 11:13.861
[Vandel straining]

11:13.941 --> 11:15.901
[Purple Goo monster growling]

11:15.991 --> 11:17.321
[gasps]

11:17.401 --> 11:19.241
Vandel,
there's no need to fight!

11:19.321 --> 11:22.241
As Princess of Fanoss,
I've declared our defeat!

11:22.331 --> 11:23.331
[Purple Goo monster growling]

11:23.411 --> 11:26.121
[VANDEL] Princess, do not worry.

11:26.871 --> 11:29.751
I'll kill
that villain momentarily.

11:29.831 --> 11:31.461
[vomits, coughs]

11:31.541 --> 11:35.801
I'll crush the kingdom's forces
and wipe them from existence.

11:35.881 --> 11:37.381
[HERTRUDE] Didn't you hear me?

11:37.471 --> 11:39.511
We lost, Vandel! It's over!

11:40.511 --> 11:43.431
[groans] Not for me, Princess.

11:46.061 --> 11:47.021
[♪ somber music playing]

11:47.101 --> 11:48.981
[young Hertrauda sobbing]

11:54.521 --> 11:55.781
Are you sure?

11:55.861 --> 11:58.571
There was no other choice
available to us?

11:58.651 --> 12:01.281
The nobility
and common people agree

12:01.371 --> 12:03.701
war with the kingdom
is in our interest.

12:03.991 --> 12:05.371
So, yes,

12:05.451 --> 12:07.371
the only option we had
was to do away

12:07.451 --> 12:08.791
with the king and queen.

12:08.871 --> 12:11.791
But there's no point
crying over it now.

12:11.881 --> 12:15.091
Buck up, you'll get revenge
for your family soon enough.

12:15.761 --> 12:17.881
If you're truly a knight
of the principality,

12:17.971 --> 12:19.801
put aside your useless regrets.

12:20.471 --> 12:21.391
[gasps]

12:24.931 --> 12:26.471
[young Hertrauda sobbing]

12:29.601 --> 12:30.771
-[VANDEL] Princesses.
-[gasps]

12:35.361 --> 12:36.321
Vandel.

12:38.191 --> 12:39.491
I will protect you.

12:40.401 --> 12:41.701
Both of you girls.

12:41.781 --> 12:44.241
And while I know I can
never replace your parents,

12:44.321 --> 12:47.001
I will fight for you
and your sister in their stead.

12:48.621 --> 12:50.121
Really? Will you?

12:50.661 --> 12:51.831
♪

12:52.831 --> 12:54.841
I swear to you upon this sword!

12:58.971 --> 13:00.591
This cannot end.

13:01.221 --> 13:03.471
This cannot be the end!

13:04.221 --> 13:05.681
Vandel.

13:06.761 --> 13:08.681
[VANDEL] I shall fight
until I'm killed

13:08.771 --> 13:10.561
and continue even afterwards.

13:10.641 --> 13:13.651
That's the only way I can find
any sort of redemption.

13:13.731 --> 13:15.861
I both live and die.

13:18.191 --> 13:21.861
By the code of chivalry!

13:21.951 --> 13:24.621
-[yells]
-[both grunt]

13:26.701 --> 13:27.621
[groans]

13:28.491 --> 13:30.411
[LEON] Die!

13:30.501 --> 13:32.371
Bastard!

13:34.381 --> 13:35.291
[gasps]

13:35.381 --> 13:36.921
[both grunt]

13:37.001 --> 13:39.301
[grunts]

13:40.971 --> 13:42.921
[laughs]

13:43.011 --> 13:44.261
[gasps]

13:44.341 --> 13:47.391
[gasping]

13:51.931 --> 13:53.061
Damn it!

13:56.561 --> 13:58.521
[groans]

13:58.611 --> 13:59.821
Luxion!

14:00.821 --> 14:03.611
[VANDEL] I'm taking you
with me! [gasps]

14:05.411 --> 14:06.821
[LEON] Sorry, old-timer.

14:07.281 --> 14:08.701
You're on your own.

14:11.201 --> 14:12.251
[LUXION] Impact.

14:14.251 --> 14:17.381
[screaming]

14:26.261 --> 14:27.141
[HERTRUDE] Vandel!

14:27.221 --> 14:30.141
[growling]

14:37.901 --> 14:39.561
[Purple Goo monster squealing]

14:39.651 --> 14:40.651
[grunts]

14:42.741 --> 14:43.611
[HERTRUDE] Vandel!

14:44.191 --> 14:47.201
You can't die! Stay with me!

14:47.281 --> 14:48.531
Say something!

14:49.371 --> 14:52.451
My dear princess, I...

14:52.541 --> 14:54.291
This is goodbye.

14:54.371 --> 14:56.711
My final battle has been fought.

14:56.791 --> 14:58.291
Don't say that!

14:58.381 --> 15:00.251
You're the only family
I've got left!

15:01.291 --> 15:04.221
I know. I'm sorry.

15:04.301 --> 15:05.671
[MARIE] You heard her!

15:05.761 --> 15:07.721
You don't have permission
to croak!

15:07.801 --> 15:09.971
What? Have you lost it?

15:10.051 --> 15:11.601
You know he's the Black Knight?

15:12.061 --> 15:13.521
Duh, of course.

15:13.601 --> 15:16.271
After all the problems
he's caused us, how could I not?

15:16.351 --> 15:17.481
But that doesn't matter.

15:17.561 --> 15:18.691
[gasps]

15:18.771 --> 15:20.521
[♪ somber music playing]

15:20.611 --> 15:23.481
Well, jerk? You gonna be selfish
and leave her all alone?

15:23.571 --> 15:24.901
[gasps]

15:26.401 --> 15:28.781
[grumbles]

15:29.371 --> 15:30.451
[VANDEL] Good.

15:30.531 --> 15:32.411
There are others like me.

15:32.491 --> 15:35.161
People who care
about the princess.

15:35.251 --> 15:36.911
I can finally rest.

15:49.841 --> 15:52.101
You've won, boy.

15:53.101 --> 15:56.141
Promise me one thing.

15:57.851 --> 15:58.901
Anything.

16:01.981 --> 16:04.191
Find happiness in this life.

16:07.191 --> 16:08.531
Vandel!

16:10.661 --> 16:13.121
[sobbing]

16:16.621 --> 16:17.501
-[rumbling]
-[all gasp]

16:18.211 --> 16:19.211
[growls]

16:24.251 --> 16:25.921
[growling]

16:31.591 --> 16:34.141
Hey. What did I just tell you?

16:34.221 --> 16:35.641
You can't stay here.

16:35.721 --> 16:37.731
Unless you wanna die with me.

16:38.391 --> 16:40.271
-B-But...
-[gasps]

16:41.231 --> 16:42.901
[CLEARE] Come along,
both of you.

16:42.981 --> 16:44.191
And please hurry.

16:49.781 --> 16:51.151
[growling]

16:51.241 --> 16:52.531
[HERTRUDE] Let's end this.

16:55.081 --> 16:56.531
[whooshing]

16:56.621 --> 16:57.501
[gasps]

17:02.751 --> 17:04.341
[♪ gentle music playing]

17:08.301 --> 17:10.131
Leon, you're staying?

17:10.551 --> 17:11.681
I should have known.

17:11.761 --> 17:13.141
I'm in position.

17:13.221 --> 17:14.511
So now what, bud?

17:15.011 --> 17:17.141
[LUXION] Against an endlessly
regenerating enemy,

17:17.221 --> 17:18.931
I fear your options are limited.

17:19.021 --> 17:21.431
Additionally, Olivia has been

17:21.521 --> 17:22.941
-severely weakened.
-[CLEARE] Luxion.

17:23.901 --> 17:24.771
What's up?

17:26.861 --> 17:28.441
[LUXION] Understood, Cleare.

17:28.531 --> 17:30.071
The main ship is out of range,

17:30.151 --> 17:32.491
so I shall gather energy
in the Arroganz.

17:33.281 --> 17:34.951
[LEON] What do you mean
out of range?

17:35.031 --> 17:37.031
Like, for what?

17:39.371 --> 17:40.871
[LUXION] Olivia's power.

17:42.331 --> 17:43.461
Mr. Leon.

17:44.881 --> 17:47.501
[LEON] Livia. Angie.

17:48.171 --> 17:50.881
[LUXION] I will add
her wavelength to your attack.

17:56.051 --> 17:59.511
[LEON] It's time to go big
or go home.

17:59.601 --> 18:00.931
[growls]

18:05.731 --> 18:07.611
[monsters growling]

18:08.231 --> 18:09.321
[JULIUS] Don't let them
get close!

18:09.401 --> 18:11.191
[ALL] Don't tell us what to do!

18:12.151 --> 18:15.161
♪

18:27.341 --> 18:28.251
[LUXION] Fabulous.

18:37.641 --> 18:39.261
[growling]

18:49.821 --> 18:52.031
[cracking]

19:00.701 --> 19:02.041
-[shatters]
-[gasps]

19:06.831 --> 19:09.881
[HERTRUDE] He didn't have to,
but he saved me.

19:10.751 --> 19:12.461
[SOLDIER 1]
The monster's been killed!

19:12.551 --> 19:14.551
-[SOLDIER 2] We did it!
-[all soldiers cheering]

19:14.631 --> 19:18.301
[LEON] All in a day's work.
So much for the final boss.

19:18.391 --> 19:19.931
[LUXION] So much for Arroganz.

19:20.011 --> 19:23.311
-It has reached its limit.
-[Leon gasps, screams]

19:23.391 --> 19:25.891
[screaming]

19:25.981 --> 19:27.481
-[Olivia gasps]
-[ANGELICA] Leon!

19:31.191 --> 19:33.571
[CLEARE] Oh, you boys. [giggles]

19:37.401 --> 19:40.321
[waves lapping]

19:47.831 --> 19:48.711
[LEON] Look.

19:49.211 --> 19:51.381
Be brutally honest,
did I do the right thing?

19:53.551 --> 19:55.591
I'm supposed to be
an unimportant mob,

19:55.671 --> 19:58.841
living an unimportant life
and minding my own business.

20:00.051 --> 20:02.141
But tons of people
ended up dying,

20:02.221 --> 20:04.721
and I was responsible
for a lot of those deaths.

20:05.471 --> 20:08.481
If a protagonist type
had been calling the shots,

20:09.021 --> 20:10.861
would things
have turned out differently?

20:12.981 --> 20:15.571
[LUXION] You overestimate
your importance.

20:15.651 --> 20:17.741
The war would've happened
either way.

20:17.821 --> 20:20.871
And it is not like
anybody expected much from you.

20:21.911 --> 20:25.201
[scoffs] Know what?
You can be a real dick.

20:27.001 --> 20:27.951
[sighs]

20:28.461 --> 20:31.501
That's me. Just an NPC
with no bearing on this world.

20:32.461 --> 20:34.751
Regardless,
I'm surprised we won.

20:34.841 --> 20:35.961
[♪ gentle music playing]

20:36.381 --> 20:38.881
[LUXION] Why is that?
Because this world subscribed

20:38.971 --> 20:41.391
to the rules of your
so-called "otome game"?

20:42.011 --> 20:44.431
Huh? I'm not following.

20:45.181 --> 20:46.561
[LUXION] You are
always complaining

20:46.641 --> 20:48.891
about how trite
and contrived everything is.

20:49.521 --> 20:51.351
In the end, are you surprised?

20:51.441 --> 20:53.231
-Love was the answer.
-[gasps]

20:57.231 --> 20:59.441
[Leon laughing]

21:03.871 --> 21:04.991
[water splashes]

21:08.791 --> 21:10.161
Leon!

21:10.251 --> 21:12.171
Mr. Leon!

21:12.791 --> 21:14.791
They're safe. Good.

21:17.171 --> 21:20.011
[LUXION] You may be
just a non-player character,

21:20.091 --> 21:22.301
but their feelings for you
are real.

21:22.931 --> 21:25.681
The truth is, that is
what ended the fighting.

21:26.891 --> 21:28.101
Is it not about time

21:28.181 --> 21:30.061
you made your decision
for their sake?

21:31.101 --> 21:32.731
You do love them, correct?

21:35.061 --> 21:36.861
[LEON] I don't think you get it.

21:37.481 --> 21:39.481
I want to take care of them both

21:40.071 --> 21:41.781
because I love them.

21:44.991 --> 21:47.871
I haven't given much thought
to what I'm gonna say,

21:47.951 --> 21:50.291
but for now,
I think this will do.

21:52.121 --> 21:53.001
We made it.

21:55.041 --> 21:56.961
[♪ closing theme song playing]

23:25.841 --> 23:28.641
[LEON] The fighting's over!
Peace has been restored,

23:28.721 --> 23:30.261
- and my brother's engaged?!
-[LUXION] Master.

23:30.351 --> 23:33.391
[LEON] Ya boi's screams echo
across an inescapable future!

23:33.471 --> 23:35.141
-[LUXION] Master?
-[LEON] The final episode,

23:35.221 --> 23:36.981
"This World Is Tough for Mobs."

23:37.061 --> 23:39.941
Turns out the final boss
of life is freakin' romance!
